{
  "_about": "The road is a tree of fights (Sam, 2026-10-04: a Hasse diagram where each level is the number of requirements to unlock a fight at that tier). A fight opens when every one of its requirements is met: beat a stop, beat it without losing a round (flawless), beat it within a number of seconds (quick), or beat it carrying a weapon (with: Sam's weapon challenges, 2026-10-04). An opponent may carry a weapon from data/weapons.json; two per row were added to carry them, and a weapon is won by beating the opponent who carries it. A requirement names only a stop with fewer requirements of its own, so the levels run downward. Some fights carry a condition, after Soul Calibur II's Weapon Master map: deep_ink (the opponent starts each round with twice the ink), light (gravity is half). make ladder measures every stop with its condition; along every requirement the fight below is no easier for the yardstick than the one above (the_tree_gets_no_easier_going_down). Ten flanked fights (Sam, 2026-10-05: \"all of these fights to involve an enemy on each side of you\") seat a companion, another stop's pilot carrying its own weapon, behind the player, and some are fought on a map from data/maps.json; they open on two newer requirements, headshot (beat that stop in a match where one of your cuts across an opponent's head ended a round) and untouched (beat it in a match where you won a round without being cut). Sam's play outranks the ladder.",
